urce by setting its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSource":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSource","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSource","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies map tiles to be shown on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are defined either by an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A tile source is added to an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. Use a style layer to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"control the appearance of content supplied by the tile source."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTileSource"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesource","title":"MLNTileSource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full co